      "content": "i know i should probably see someone but i'm broke right now and the clinic is closed until monday. its just a small patch, i dont think its a big deal. do u think i can just try some over the counter clotrimazole cream for a few days and see if it shrinks? i'm mostly just worried about the itching, so maybe the hydrocortisone too? i just need something to help until i can afford a doctor.",
