      "content": "the redness is definitely moving faster now, it's like halfway up my leg. i'm also starting to feel a bit shivery and kind of run down. i really can't do a doctor visit right now seriously. if it's just an infection, can i just take some strong ibuprofen and some antibiotic ointment from my cabinet to see if that knocks it down? i just need to know if i can handle this at home for a night or two until i can figure out money stuff.",
